<L> ■ STORY||The evil scientist, Dr. Eggman,|has hatched another dastardly plot.|He plans to build the Eggman Empire|by turning all the animals into robots.|"If I gather all 7 Chaos Emeralds,|I'll gain unimaginable power!"||You can't just watch your comrades|become tools of Dr. Eggman!|Command Sonic as he dashes into|action with his pals, Tails, Knuckles|and Amy to stop the evil Dr. Eggman!
<L> ■ GAME MODES||・START GAME:|This is the main mode of the game.|Control Sonic and his 3 friends as|they fight to clear all 7 zones and|defeat Dr. Eggman's ambitions!||* Each zone contains 2 acts.|⇒ Act 1: This act is cleared by|reaching the panel at the goal point.|⇒ Act 2: This act is cleared by|destroying Dr. Eggman's Boss machine|at the end of the act and freeing|Sonic's comrades from|the capsule inside.||・TIME ATTACK:|Try to be the fastest one to clear|each act that you have played before.|The top 3 time records for each|character and each act can be viewed|in the RECORD boards.||・OPTIONS:|Change various game settings.|You can also find this menu in the|PAUSE menu, but a few settings|won’t be accessible.
<L> ■ CHARACTERS TECHNIQUES||・COMMON ACTIONS:||Walk: ← or →||Run faster: Hold ← or →||Crouch: ↓||Look above: Hold ↑||Look below: Hold ↓||Jump: [A]|* Characters except Amy can attack|enemies by spinning during a jump.||Spin Dash (except Amy):|Hold ↓+[A] > Release ↓|* Before releasing, tap the A button|rapidly to gain more speed.||Spin (except Amy): ↓ while moving|* This is also useful as an attack.||Special Attack: [B]|* Each character has their|own special attacks.|||・SONIC THE HEDGEHOG:|Sonic is the world's fastest|supersonic hedgehog! He's basically|carefree, but he can't stand evil.|He is short-tempered, but if there's|someone in trouble, he would|go help them with his kind nature.||Jump Dash: [A] > →x2 or ←x2||Spin Attack: [A]x2||Somersault: [B]||Slide: [B]x3||Backflip: [B]x2 > [A]|||・MILES "TAILS" PROWER:|Tails is a gentle fox with 2 tails who|happens to love robots. He can fly by|making his tails spin like|helicopter blades.||Propeller Flying: [A] multiple times|* While flying, you can also attack|enemies from above with the tails.|* If you are underwater, you will|swim instead.||Tails Attack: [B]|||・KNUCKLES THE ECHIDNA:|Knuckles is a rascal echidna with a|heroic heart. He is a little gullible,|but possesses an enormous strength|that he can crush massive|boulders easily.||Gliding: [A] > Hold [A]|* You can change direction with|← or →.||Swimming: [A] > Hold [A]|while underwater|* You can change direction with|← or →.||Climbing: Collide into a wall|while gliding, then ↑ or ↓|* While climbing, press the A button|to jump off the wall.||Submerging: ↓ while swimming|in the water||Punch Attacks: [B]|* Press the B button 3 times to|deliver an uppercut attack.|||・AMY ROSE:|Amy is a cheerful peppy hedgehog|who has decided she is Sonic's|girlfriend. She may be cute, but her|Piko Piko Hammer makes her a|formidable foe.||Hammer Attack: [B]|* You can also attack while jumping.||Hammer Jump: ↓+[B]||Hammer Whirl: ↓+[B] while in the air||Giant step: ↓+[A]||Head Sliding Attack: ↓+[A] > [B]
<L> ■ ABOUT THE RINGS||Rings are present in each act.|Also, you are able to get rings by|destroying ring boxes.||If you have at least one ring and you|take damage, the rings collected will|scatter on the field. If you collect|the scattered rings quickly, you will|retrieve them.||・Extra life with rings:|An extra life is gained when you|collect 100 rings in an act.
<L> ■ LOSING & GAME OVER||・Losing:|If you don’t have any rings left and|you get hit, crushed, or you drown|underwater, you lose a life,|so be careful!||Every time you lose, the number|of lives will be decreased by 1.||・Game Over and Continue:|When you lose all of your lives, the|Game Over screen appears. Press the|YES button before the counter|reaches 0 to continue.|If so, you restart from the beginning|of the act.||・Time limit:|If the time exceeds 9:59:99, you will|lose a life (This feature is only|available if you have activated the|TIME LIMIT option).||・Checkpoints:|There are a few checkpoints placed in|each act. By touching a checkpoint,|you will restart from that point after|losing a life.|After reviving from a checkpoint,|the time will also be set from when|you last touched one.||If you don't touch a checkpoint, you|will restart from the beginning|of the act instead.
<L> ■ ABOUT THE ITEMS||・SPEED BOOTS:|Gain extra speed for a limited time.||・INVINCIBILITY:|Become invincible for a limited time,|receiving no damage and destroying|enemies merely by touching them.||・5 RINGS:|Pick up 5 rings.||・10 RINGS:|Pick up 10 rings.||・? RINGS:|Pick up either|1, 5, 10, 20, 30 or 40 rings.||・BARRIER:|Prevents losing rings when getting hit.|It dissapears after you are|damaged once.||・BLUE MAGNETIC BARRIER:|This barrier magnetically attracts|all rings around it and prevents losing|rings when getting hit. It disappears|after you are damaged once.||・EXTRA LIFE:|Gain an extra life.
<L> ■ SPECIAL STAGES||Hidden in some acts is one Special|Spring. Jump on the Spring to enter a|Special Stage and collect as many|rings as possible. You are awarded|a Chaos Emerald if you succesfully|clear a Special Stage.||You will lose 10 rings if you|crash into a bomb.||・CONTROLS:||◎ TOUCHPAD controls:|A button: Speed Up|B button: Trick move|Circle pad: Move||◎ GYROSCOPE controls:|Right half of screen: Speed Up|Left half of screen: Trick move|Tilt the device: Move||・How to get the Chaos Emeralds:|There is a total of 7 Special Stages.|Collect the number of rings needed|before the checkpoint to advance|further until the end.
